{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Launching Over It</strong> is a challenging and emotional journey through levels inspired by the developer\u2019s childhood memories. To reach the end, you\u2019ll need to overcome all kinds of obstacles\u2014by launching a ball. Sounds simple? Think again.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Inspired by <i>Getting Over It with Bennett Foddy</i> and <i>Golfing Over It with Alva Majo</i>, this game will test your patience, skill, and determination.</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Frustrating, yet fair gameplay.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Risk of starting over.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Precision-based launching mechanics.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">References to iconic places, series, and video games.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">A nostalgic and emotional ending.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Can you make it to the top?</p></li></ul>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3593180?t=1745329746","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3593180?t=1745329746","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3593180/cd9c26ded77d866a0b35b98c538ced2b2c419770/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1745329746","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3593180/cd9c26ded77d866a0b35b98c538ced2b2c419770/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1745329746","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Steam Achievements","id":22},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Launching Over It</strong> is a challenging and emotional journey through levels inspired by the developer\u2019s childhood memories. To reach the end, you\u2019ll need to overcome all kinds of obstacles\u2014by launching a ball. Sounds simple? T